---
// The public root. v1's only public surface is the Niyamavali, so the root sends
// the visitor there (preserving a `?lang=` override if present). A server redirect —
// no client JS. Downstream public surfaces (Epic 11a/11b) extend this shell.
return Astro.redirect(
  Astro.url.searchParams.has('lang')
    ? `/niyamavali?lang=${encodeURIComponent(Astro.url.searchParams.get('lang') ?? '')}`
    : '/niyamavali',
  302,
);
---
